<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It itches, Elder Brother.</font>

57
00:02:43,050 --> 00:02:46,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... feels like I'm getting a rash.</font>

58
