<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This feels so good!</font>

64
00:03:23,050 --> 00:03:25,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with those guys anyway?</font>

65
00:03:27,220 --> 00:03:29,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're an idiot brat as always.</font>

66
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have it hard, don't you?</font>

67
00:03:32,230 --> 00:03:34,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Having to go on a mission
