68
00:03:36,020 --> 00:03:37,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you, Iruka?</font>

69
00:03:37,980 --> 00:03:39,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why Mizuki?!</font>

70
00:03:41,860 --> 00:03:44,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm asking you please stop
this kind of foolishness!</font>

71
00:03:44,990 --> 00:03:47,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you intending to betray
your comrades from the village again?</font>

72
