<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Comrades?</font>

73
00:03:50,660 --> 00:03:52,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!
Your comrades from the Leaf Village</font>

74
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with whom you shared
both pleasures and pain!</font>

75
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can understand that,
can't you?</font>

76
00:03:56,500 --> 00:03:58,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Comrades... huh?</font>

77
00:04:09,890 --> 00:04:12,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As usual you are naive
aren't you... Iruka?</font>

78
00:04:14,020 --> 00:04:16,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What I believe in is power!</font>

79
00:04:16,860 --> 00:04:21,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't think you can shackle me with
such vague bonds like that of comrades!</font>

80
00:04:21,820 --> 00:04:22,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki...</font>

81
00:04:23,030 --> 00:04:26,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will soon get my hands
on the ultimate power!</font>

82
00:04:26,820 --> 00:04:28,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama's power!</font>

83
