<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru?!</font>

84
00:04:35,250 --> 00:04:37,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll teach you a lesson!</font>

85
00:04:38,130 --> 00:04:39,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">About how meaningless it is...</font>

86
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:42,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that thing you and the other Leaf guys
describe as camaraderie or whatever!</font>

87
00:04:43,170 --> 00:04:44,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki...</font>

88
