<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were an excellent Shinobi despite
having committed that crime you...</font>

89
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:50,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't talk so knowingly!</font>

90
00:04:57,480 --> 00:05:01,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! They're dodging all my attacks!</font>

91
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:06,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka, if you insist so much
why don't you show me?</font>

92
00:05:07,700 --> 00:05:11,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What degree of feeling
you really have for your comrades...</font>

93
