<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come!</font>

95
00:05:17,540 --> 00:05:18,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

96
00:05:19,590 --> 00:05:22,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Forget about these guys!
Pursue Mizuki!</font>

97
00:05:23,590 --> 00:05:25,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...!</font>

98
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:29,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna settle this later
without fail!</font>

99
00:05:33,350 --> 00:05:36,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother, that guy went off.</font>

