<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They all went off, didn't they?</font>

101
00:05:41,020 --> 00:05:44,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother, could this be
a game of hide-and-go-seek?</font>

102
00:05:44,650 --> 00:05:46,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hide-and-go-seek! Hide-and-go-seek!</font>

103
00:05:47,530 --> 00:05:50,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So does that mean we're "It"?</font>

104
00:05:53,620 --> 00:05:55,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those jerks!</font>

105
00:05:55,660 --> 00:05:58,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Making us "It" without even deciding
