<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Three-Man Group</font>

109
00:05:59,630 --> 00:06:04,420
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Two People</font>

110
