<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">and a Dog!</font>

111
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over here... Iruka.</font>

112
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:14,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry, Naruto!</font>

113
00:06:15,060 --> 00:06:16,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be fooled this time!</font>

114
00:06:17,100 --> 00:06:20,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up! It's 100 years too soon
to be arguing with me!</font>

115
00:06:21,190 --> 00:06:22,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you</font>

116
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:25,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you mess around the situation's gonna
get really troublesome again!</font>

117
00:06:25,780 --> 00:06:26,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

118
00:06:27,990 --> 00:06:29,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Found you!</font>

119
00:06:35,290 --> 00:06:37,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good job, huh, Elder Brother!</font>

120
00:06:37,330 --> 00:06:38,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

121
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:42,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have time to be
dealing with these guys!</font>

122
00:06:43,460 --> 00:06:47,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother, hide-and-go-seek is fun
but aren't you getting hungry?</font>

123
00:06:47,340 --> 00:06:50,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're really something
aren't you, Raijin?</font>

124
00:06:54,060 --> 00:06:56,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave some for your Elder Brother!</font>

125
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:58,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course I will!</font>

126
00:06:58,480 --> 00:07:00,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you idiot brothers!</font>

127
