<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?
— Huh?</font>

128
00:07:01,690 --> 00:07:04,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is no time to be eating!</font>

129
00:07:04,900 --> 00:07:08,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you it's foolhardy
to be fighting these guys!</font>

130
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I already know that!</font>

131
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:17,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki! Where are you?!</font>

132
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:21,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter... Iruka?</font>

133
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:25,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Weren't you gonna stop me?</font>

134
00:07:30,300 --> 00:07:32,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop this foolishness, Mizuki!</font>

135
00:07:34,430 --> 00:07:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on out, Mizuki!</font>

136
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:52,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Always be aware of
an attack from behind...</font>

137
00:07:52,780 --> 00:07:55,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For a Shinobi
isn't that a basic rule?</font>

138
00:08:09,710 --> 00:08:12,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nicely done, Iruka.</font>

139
00:08:15,510 --> 00:08:17,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pretty good!</font>

140
00:08:18,260 --> 00:08:20,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Always read behind the surface
of your enemy's bluffs...</font>

141
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:23,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For a Shinobi isn't that a basic rule?</font>

142
00:08:25,310 --> 00:08:27,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my line!</font>

143
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:33,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?</font>

144
00:08:33,530 --> 00:08:34,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Smoke Bomb?</font>

145
00:08:35,030 --> 00:08:36,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

146
00:08:38,450 --> 00:08:42,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Come on over! Catch us if you can!
— Come on over! Catch us if you can!</font>

147
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:44,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother they're increasing!
They're increasing!</font>

148
00:08:44,670 --> 00:08:48,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raijin, this must be
super hide-and-go-seek, don't you think?</font>

149
00:08:48,130 --> 00:08:49,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. That's right!</font>

150
00:08:50,500 --> 00:08:53,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A decoy strategy, huh?
You thought it through.</font>

151
00:08:54,180 --> 00:08:57,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can buy some time this way.</font>

152
00:08:57,090 --> 00:08:58,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, now's our chance...</font>

153
00:08:58,680 --> 00:09:01,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Super super hide-and-go-seek!
— Super super hide-and-go-seek!</font>

154
00:09:24,460 --> 00:09:27,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are,
there are two Grandma Tsunades!</font>

155
00:09:28,330 --> 00:09:30,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're talking about
the idiotic strength, huh?</font>

156
00:09:33,260 --> 00:09:35,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haven't you come to
your senses yet?!</font>

157
00:09:35,670 --> 00:09:36,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

158
00:09:39,260 --> 00:09:41,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you so obsessed with power!</font>

159
00:09:42,310 --> 00:09:44,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because that if anything
is everything!</font>

160
00:09:44,310 --> 00:09:47,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Reconsider, Mizuki!
It isn't too late yet!</font>

161
00:09:48,940 --> 00:09:50,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are naive!</font>

162
00:09:51,070 --> 00:09:52,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you understand the situation?!</font>

163
00:09:57,820 --> 00:10:00,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?
Come on and attack, Iruka!</font>

164
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not my enemy!</font>

165
00:10:01,950 --> 00:10:03,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're my comrade from
the same village!</font>

166
00:10:03,950 --> 00:10:06,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you I'm tired of that kind of
song and dance!</font>

167
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:10,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And moreover...
you're my colleague!</font>

168
00:10:10,420 --> 00:10:14,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a member of the same family
that inherited the same Will of Fire!</font>

169
00:10:16,010 --> 00:10:17,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will of Fire, huh?</font>

170
00:10:17,470 --> 00:10:18,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, that's right.</font>

171
00:10:19,050 --> 00:10:21,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore please stop
the foolishness, Mizuki!</font>

172
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:24,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It irks me most when
you say things like that!</font>

173
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:25,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki!</font>

174
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:30,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since we're old acquaintances
I was gonna kill you quickly.</font>

175
00:10:30,650 --> 00:10:31,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But now I've decided against that.</font>

176
00:10:32,860 --> 00:10:34,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're gonna have some fun...</font>

177
00:10:35,150 --> 00:10:36,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give you a taste of how it feels</font>

178
00:10:36,530 --> 00:10:38,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to be killed slowly by
your so-called comrade!</font>

179
00:10:50,580 --> 00:10:54,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey Naruto... How long are you
planning to be like that?</font>

180
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:57,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just a matter of time till
those guys find you!</font>

181
00:11:02,180 --> 00:11:03,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found you!</font>

182
00:11:04,010 --> 00:11:05,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! They found us!</font>

183
00:11:07,350 --> 00:11:09,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! This is it!</font>

184
00:11:09,190 --> 00:11:10,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hide-and-go-seek!</font>

185
00:11:10,350 --> 00:11:11,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hide-and-go-seek!</font>

186
00:11:12,150 --> 00:11:13,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

187
00:11:15,940 --> 00:11:19,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother,
super hide-and-go-seek again?</font>

188
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:21,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm getting bored with this.</font>

189
00:11:24,490 --> 00:11:26,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone again?!</font>

190
00:11:26,290 --> 00:11:28,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As always
you have no new tricks, huh!</font>

191
00:11:29,370 --> 00:11:31,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just leave it to me!</font>

192
00:11:31,330 --> 00:11:32,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Go!</font>

193
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:34,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Okay!
— Go!</font>

194
00:11:35,670 --> 00:11:37,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What?!</font>

195
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:39,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind of game is this?</font>

196
00:11:44,140 --> 00:11:46,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow, they're going so fast.</font>

197
00:11:46,760 --> 00:11:49,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... Not bad.</font>

198
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I feel sick... Elder Brother.</font>

199
00:11:53,270 --> 00:11:55,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm woozy...</font>

200
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now! Catch them!</font>

201
00:11:59,690 --> 00:12:00,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

202
00:12:02,660 --> 00:12:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerks...</font>

203
00:12:04,370 --> 00:12:06,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think you're doing?</font>

204
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:08,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The preparation's done!</font>

205
00:12:09,660 --> 00:12:12,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it goes!
You fatso Herculean brothers!</font>

206
00:12:21,630 --> 00:12:24,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate... I must concentrate...</font>

207
00:12:33,690 --> 00:12:35,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop putting on airs!</font>

208
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:37,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A guy like you
who's weaker than me!</font>

209
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:39,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! That's right, isn't it?!</font>

210
00:12:41,650 --> 00:12:44,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You always excelled over
anything I did, didn't you...?</font>

211
00:12:45,610 --> 00:12:48,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was always being helped by you,
wasn't I?</font>

212
00:12:51,450 --> 00:12:53,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One year has passed already, hasn't it?</font>

213
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:59,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not so easy to laugh
hiding your sadness.</font>

214
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:05,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your teacher told me that
you are the center of the laughter.</font>

215
00:13:05,760 --> 00:13:07,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not sad at all!</font>

216
00:13:08,260 --> 00:13:10,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an honour for Shinobi
to die during their missions!</font>

217
00:13:11,350 --> 00:13:13,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My dad and mom...</font>

218
00:13:13,230 --> 00:13:17,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are heroes who protected this village
from the Demon Fox!</font>

219
00:13:18,190 --> 00:13:20,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I am the child of those heroes.</font>

220
00:13:20,730 --> 00:13:23,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I'm not sad
even though I'm alone...</font>

221
00:13:25,070 --> 00:13:27,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These tears are from the happiness...</font>

222
00:13:27,410 --> 00:13:28,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enough already.</font>

223
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:36,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm always aware that
you are feeling lonely.</font>

224
00:13:38,540 --> 00:13:41,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you are not alone.</font>

225
00:13:43,550 --> 00:13:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All of Leaf's Shinobi
have the "Will of Fire."</font>

226
00:13:49,090 --> 00:13:50,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Will of Fire"?</font>

227
00:13:50,680 --> 00:13:54,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It means the will to protect the Leaf.</font>

228
00:13:54,890 --> 00:13:57,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as you have
the Will of Fire</font>

229
00:13:57,690 --> 00:14:01,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you and people in this village
are all family.</font>

230
00:14:02,230 --> 00:14:06,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka, I wonder if you have that.</font>

231
00:14:10,490 --> 00:14:11,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

232
00:14:18,210 --> 00:14:19,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

233
00:14:22,500 --> 00:14:24,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's that over there?</font>

234
00:14:33,760 --> 00:14:34,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki...</font>

235
00:14:35,020 --> 00:14:37,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing there?</font>

236
00:14:37,730 --> 00:14:42,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I heard that Iruka
was depressed these days...</font>

237
00:14:42,650 --> 00:14:45,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was worried and came to look for him.</font>

238
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:49,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everybody's... worried about you, Iruka.</font>

239
00:14:50,450 --> 00:14:53,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everybody's waiting over there.
Come on and play with us!</font>

240
00:14:57,500 --> 00:14:59,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all right... Go on.</font>

241
00:15:11,590 --> 00:15:15,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Mizuki that I idolized was kind...</font>

242
00:15:16,390 --> 00:15:19,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he was a guy who was more
thoughtful of his friends than anyone else.</font>

243
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:20,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yet...</font>

244
00:15:22,730 --> 00:15:24,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please remember! Mizuki!</font>

245
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really are...</font>

246
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:30,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">an idiot, aren't you?!</font>

247
00:15:34,870 --> 00:15:37,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">L-Let go...</font>

248
00:15:37,660 --> 00:15:38,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it goes...</font>

249
00:15:38,830 --> 00:15:41,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Stop please!</font>

250
00:15:42,170 --> 00:15:44,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I feel sick...</font>

251
00:15:51,300 --> 00:15:52,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?
— Eh?</font>

252
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:54,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

253
00:15:58,020 --> 00:16:00,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother, don't tell me that you...</font>

254
00:16:00,980 --> 00:16:04,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry Raijin... I squashed...</font>

255
00:16:04,980 --> 00:16:07,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">our lunch!</font>

256
00:16:07,230 --> 00:16:09,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

257
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:17,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stay still guys!</font>

258
00:16:17,950 --> 00:16:21,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now take this...!</font>

259
00:16:21,250 --> 00:16:24,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Give us back our lunch!
— Give us back our lunch!</font>

260
00:16:24,460 --> 00:16:25,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

261
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:34,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-He's done it, huh...</font>

262
00:16:44,520 --> 00:16:47,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't look like you understand me
so let me explain.</font>

263
00:16:48,230 --> 00:16:51,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The real reason I was kind to you...</font>

264
00:16:52,650 --> 00:16:55,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because it made me happy
more than anything</font>

265
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:57,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to see you in your misery!</font>

266
00:17:02,620 --> 00:17:04,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Iruka!</font>

267
00:17:05,830 --> 00:17:07,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're gonna go play football right now.</font>

268
00:17:08,540 --> 00:17:10,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come join us, Iruka!</font>

269
00:17:12,260 --> 00:17:13,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure! Okay!</font>

270
00:17:15,550 --> 00:17:16,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if Iruka's okay</font>

271
00:17:16,590 --> 00:17:19,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">after all those things
that happened to him...</font>

272
00:17:19,260 --> 00:17:21,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why we need to
try to cheer him up!</font>

273
00:17:23,310 --> 00:17:25,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... only him...</font>

274
00:17:30,070 --> 00:17:31,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everybody makes a fuss about him</font>

275
00:17:31,690 --> 00:17:33,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">just because of his parents
getting killed by Nine-Tail...</font>

276
00:17:36,030 --> 00:17:37,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Serves you right...</font>

277
00:17:41,580 --> 00:17:42,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even Lord Hokage?!</font>

278
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:50,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... why is it?!</font>

279
00:17:53,260 --> 00:17:55,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is it over there?</font>

280
00:17:59,340 --> 00:18:00,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right...</font>

281
00:18:00,510 --> 00:18:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna try to gain the favor
of Lord Hokage too...</font>

282
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:05,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing over there?</font>

283
00:18:06,180 --> 00:18:10,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I heard that Iruka has been
depressed recently so...</font>

284
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:13,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're lying!</font>

285
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:15,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Treating a guy who's weaker
than oneself with disdain</font>

286
00:18:15,610 --> 00:18:18,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is the most pleasurable
feeling of all, Iruka.</font>

287
00:18:19,360 --> 00:18:21,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You weren't that way in the past!</font>

288
00:18:22,450 --> 00:18:25,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I've been telling you...
you're naive!</font>

289
00:18:26,410 --> 00:18:29,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kind of naivete leads to fatal mistakes
on the battleground.</font>

290
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:34,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On the battleground it's all about
how many enemies you can kill!</font>

291
00:18:37,550 --> 00:18:39,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you throw a Kunai blindly
in a bamboo grove</font>

292
00:18:39,340 --> 00:18:42,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all that will happen is that it'll bounce off
and its path will be errant.</font>

293
00:18:42,140 --> 00:18:44,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're gonna take aim...
make it straight!</font>

294
00:18:53,360 --> 00:18:54,900
